hfsplus: decrypt per-file protected regular files on S5L8947X volumes

When opening a regular file on an HFS+ volume, check for a content-protection
extended attribute and unwrap its per-file AES-256 key through the S5L8947X
key store helper when available. Decrypt 4 KiB data fork blocks in
hfsplus_read_folio() using the unwrapped per-file key and IV key.
